# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout (LANES-41): a Windows
# clone has core.autocrlf=false by default, and a file rewritten there with CRLF -- an
# ad-hoc write_text(), an editor -- would otherwise commit as a whole-file diff and hand
# every other checkout the same diff back. `eol=lf` keeps the working tree LF too, so
# the shell scripts and hooks run under sh on any platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
